## Frontend Logic (for uw-purok)

The resolve button should be **unlockable** when either:
- `resolution_confirmed_at` is **not null** (citizen confirmed), OR
- 2 hours have passed since `resolution_requested_at`

## API Reference

| Method | Endpoint | Body | Result |
|--------|----------|------|--------|
| `PUT` | `/purok-leader/concerns/{id}/status` | `{status: "resolved"}` | → `awaiting_confirmation` |
| `POST` | `/concerns/{id}/confirm-resolution` | `{confirmed: true, reason?: "..."}` | Flags concern, notifies PL |
| `POST` | `/concerns/{id}/confirm-resolution` | `{confirmed: false, reason: "..."}` | → `ongoing` |
| `PUT` | `/purok-leader/concerns/{id}/status` | `{status: "resolved"}` (2nd time) | → [resolved](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/insrno/urbanwatch/implementation_plan.md.resolved) |
